CAE-bench-TN -- an unofficial, tool-neutral variant of CAE-bench.

This directory is a derivative work of CAE-bench
(https://github.com/svd-ai-lab/cae-bench), Copyright SVD AI Lab, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see ../LICENSE). Task physics, reference
values, tolerance bands, oracles and the verifier library are upstream's; the
rendered tasks copy them unchanged. Changes made here: tool-neutral prompts,
a tool-neutral output contract, solver adapters, a dataset generator, and one
optional, default-preserving `driver` parameter in
lib/sim_benchmark_verifier/sim_benchmark_verifier/native_{cantera,pybamm}.py.

Scores produced with CAE-bench-TN are NOT CAE-bench scores and must not be
reported, compared or published as such. Rendered task names use the
namespace `caebench-tn/`.
